{"suttaId":"sn43.2","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iv","vriCode":"s0304m.mul","paras":[1873,1873],"vripara":"367"},"segments":{"sn43.2:0.3":"Samathavipassanāsuttaṃ","sn43.2:1.1":"“Asaṅkhatañca vo, bhikkhave, desessāmi asaṅkhatagāmiñca maggaṃ.","sn43.2:1.2":"Taṃ suṇātha.","sn43.2:1.3":"Katamañca, bhikkhave, asaṅkhataṃ?","sn43.2:1.4":"Yo, bhikkhave, rāgakkhayo dosakkhayo mohakkhayo – idaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, asaṅkhataṃ.","sn43.2:1.6":"Katamo ca, bhikkhave, asaṅkhatagāmimaggo?","sn43.2:1.7":"Samatho ca vipassanā ca.","sn43.2:1.8":"Ayaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, asaṅkhatagāmimaggo … pe ….","sn43.2:1.9":"Dutiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
